OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day with plenty of sunny
OL,6,Fspells and some patchy cloud. Breezy
OL,7,Fover hills and near the Lincolnshire
OL,8,Fcoast, but winds easing through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with mostly clear skies,
OL,13,Fleading to a chilly night with light
OL,14,Fwinds. A grass frost is possible by
OL,15,Fdawn for any prone rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
