OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA bright start, but cloud
OL,6,Fbuilding through the morning with a
OL,7,Ffew patches of rain possible, most
OL,8,Flikely across the Peak District.
OL,9,FBrighter spells developing elsewhere
OL,10,Flater in the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FVariable cloud and sunny spells
OL,14,FTuesday. Outbreaks of rain expected
OL,15,Ffor a time Wednesday. Fine and sunny
OL,16,FThursday. Warm by day, but chilly
OL,17,FWednesday and Thursday nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
